  "description": "Lee Ba-Da, can see \"Sappatam\" (the time it takes to fall in love). While using her ability to help others find love, she ends up falling for her childhood friend of ten years, Hyun-Jae. Due to her power, she believes that love is merely a temporary feeling caused by \"Sappatam\"... A youth romance about wounded and healed protagonists navigating a storm of emotions.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69622917/), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%82%AC%EB%9E%91%EC%97%90-%EB%B9%A0%EC%A7%80%EB%8A%94-%ED%83%80%EC%9D%B4%EB%B0%8D/4903)",
